29 ARTICLE 11 HANDBACK OF PROJECT FACILITIES Handback

As to when infrastructure backbone would be deemed to be complete is dealt with in Article 5.1 as per which infrastructure backbone will be accepted to be completed, when following events are completed:
(a) More than 90% of the envisaged banking points of services are established (i.e.
equipments are procured, connectivity established, manpower deployed) connected to the state data centres;
(b) Saving accounts for at least 95% of the enrolled beneficiaries during July-September 2008 are opened and are operational for transactions;
(c) State Data Centre is established and MIS in agreed format, generated from state data centre is provided and (d) more than 90% of the beneficiaries enrolled during July- September 2008 have been issued smart cards.
